      "title": "Lecturer, Mathematics and Statistics (Term)",
      "description": "Lecturer, Mathematics and Statistics (Term) Location Youngstown, Ohio Job Type Full-time Faculty Job Number 202600272 Division Academic Affairs Department Mathematics & Statistics Opening Date 09/30/2026 Bargaining Unit Status Ohio Education Association (OEA) Salary Grade LECT Description Benefits Questions Summary of Position Teaches a wide range of mathematics and statistics courses, which may include elementary and mathematical statistics, college algebra, quantitative reasoning, calculus, and other advanced mathematics and statistics courses. Participates in Department, College and University service activities and outreach. Develops and deliver face-to-face, hybrid, and online instruction in mathematics and statistics. Coordinates co-requisite and/or service courses in the Department and work with faculty and staff on initiatives to improve student success in mathematics and statistics courses. Interacts effectively with a diverse population of students and faculty and contribute to the success of the Department by working effectively with individuals of diverse backgrounds. Mentor graduate teaching assistants in their course assignments. Contributes through teaching, scholarship and/or service to the diversity, cultural sensitivity, and excellence of the University community. Position Information Plans, organizes, teaches, and provides feedback to promote and direct student success. Responds to students in a timely manner. Communicates with students, departments, and university officials via university provided tools and resources. An Institution of Opportunity: YSU inspires individuals, enhances futures, and enriches lives. As a student-centered university, Youngstown State University’s mission is to provide innovative lifelong learning opportunities that will inspire individuals, enhance futures and enrich lives. YSU inspires individuals by cultivating a curiosity for life-long learning; enhances the futures of our students by empowerin